<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the French</p>
<p>first division after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>19 - David Zitelli (Strasbourg), Stephane Guivarc'h (Rennes):</p>
<p>18 - Japhet N'Doram (Nantes)</p>
<p>17 - Sonny Anderson (Monaco)</p>
<p>16 - Alain Caveglia (Lyon)</p>
<p>15 - Anto Drobnjak (Bastia)</p>
<p>12 - Xavier Gravelaine (Marseille)</p>
<p>11 - Miladin Becanovic (Lille), Victor Ikpeba (Monaco)</p>
<p>10 - Lilian Laslandes (Auxerre), Jean-Pierre Papin (Bordeaux),</p>
<p>Ludovic Giuly (Lyon), Ibrahim Bakayoko (Montpellier), Jocelyn</p>
<p>Gourvennec (Nantes), Patrice Loko (Paris St Germain)</p>
</text>
